  "description": "Self‑calibrated neuromorphic hyperspectral imaging pipeline for event cameras with diffractive  illumination. Includes end‑to‑end tools for RAW segmentation, multi‑window time‑warping compensation, spectral visualization, and hardware control for synchronized event/frame capture and scanning.",
